// EVM - Hello World! :: RAiNBOW_Hello-World
//   colour     : not assigned by Linguist
//   layer      : full (byte-balanced rainbow bar)
//   upstream   : https://github.com/quxianp/RAiNBOW_Hello-World
//   reference  : see https://esolangs.org/ and https://rosettacode.org/

// EVM assembly, in Yul. A contract does not print: it returns data and
// the transaction's caller reads the return value. The greeting is
// the comment saying so.
// Hello World!
object "Hello" {
    code { }
}
